{"articleNo":"197928","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=197928&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2019 GKS Admission Call for Undergraduate School Studying at kit, Korea","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2018.09.10","hit":"4631","attachments":[{"name":"information of kit undergraduate program_Eng_배포용.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=197928&attachNo=78724"},{"name":"2019 GKS-U Application Guidelines (English)_공문용.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=197928&attachNo=79413"},{"name":"2019 GKS-U Application Guidelines (한국어)_공문용.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=197928&attachNo=79495"},{"name":"2019 GKS 정초외국인 학부 장학생 지원서 양식_공문용.docx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=197928&attachNo=79507"},{"name":"information of kit undergraduate program_한국어_배포용.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=197928&attachNo=79610"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-bidi-font-size: 13.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\">2019 </span></b><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: blue; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-bidi-font-size: 13.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\">GKS Admission Call</span></b><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-bidi-font-size: 13.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\"> for Undergraduate School Studying at kit, Korea<!--?xml:namespace prefix = \"o\" ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: #666666; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\">We are pleased to inform you of 2019 GKS (Global Korea Scholarship) Guideline for Undergraduate candidates here in Korea. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\">As the one and only national engineering specialized university in Korea, we will be able to nominate candidates up to 3. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\">This might be a great opportunity for you to be able to study in Korea with a full government scholarship.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\">Please see attached for further information and if there are any candidates interested in this program, please send me </span><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: red; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\">one original application document package </span></u></b><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: red; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\">and </span></u></b><b><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: red; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\">no later than October 17<sup>th</sup> (Wed) 2018</span></u></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\">. Your original application documents must be delivered to my office by the deadline. (There will be interview video step after documents acceptance)<o:p></o:p></span></p><p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-pagination: widow-orphan\"><span style=\"COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\"><font size=\"2\">금오공대에 방문해 주셔서 감사합니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></font><font size=\"2\">아래와 같이 </font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font size=\"2\">2019 GKS(</font></span><font size=\"2\">정부초청외국인 학부 장학생</font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font size=\"2\">) </font></span><font size=\"2\">모집요강 안내하니 많은 지원 바랍니다</font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font size=\"2\">. <o:p></o:p></font></span></font></span></p><p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-pagination: widow-orphan\"><span style=\"COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\"><font size=\"2\">우리대학은 국내 유일의 국립 공과특수대학으로서<span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span></font><font size=\"2\">총 </font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font size=\"2\">3</font></span><font size=\"2\">명의 후보자를 국립국제교육원에 추천할 수 있습니다</font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font size=\"2\">. </font></span><font size=\"2\">더 자세한 내용에 관해서는 첨부파일 확인해 주시고</font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font size=\"2\">, </font></span><font size=\"2\">구비서류 원본을</font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font size=\"2\"> 2018</font></span><font size=\"2\">년 </font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font size=\"2\">10</font></span><font size=\"2\">월 </font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font size=\"2\">17</font></span><font size=\"2\">일</font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font size=\"2\">(</font></span><font size=\"2\">수요일</font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font size=\"2\">)</font></span><font size=\"2\">까지 보내주시기 바랍니다</font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font size=\"2\">. </font></span><font size=\"2\">마감일이 지난 후에는 접수를 받지 않습니다</font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font size=\"2\">. (</font></span><font size=\"2\">서류 접수 후 동영상 인터뷰가 있을 예정입니다</font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font size=\"2\">)<o:p></o:p></font></span></font></span></p><p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-layout-grid-align: none\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: #666666; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\"><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-layout-grid-align: none\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\">1. Applicants' CGPA must be more than 2.64 on a 4.0 scale, 2.80 on a 4.3 scale, 2.91 on a 4.5 scale, 3.23 on a 5.0 scale, or 80 points or above on a 100 point scale or be ranked within the top 20% throughout the entire high school period. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-layout-grid-align: none\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\">(Exception: An applicant who have been awarded with any scholarship programs from Korea for an undergraduate degree program is not eligible to apply)<o:p></o:p></span></p><p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-layout-grid-align: none\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: #666666; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></b>&nbsp;</p><p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-layout-grid-align: none\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\">2. Applicants who submit applications to more than two designated institutions will be disqualified.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-layout-grid-align: none\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\"><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-layout-grid-align: none\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\">3. Scholarship duration: 1 yr. of Korean Language + 4 yrs. of Bachelor’s<o:p></o:p></span></p><p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-layout-grid-align: none\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\"><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-layout-grid-align: none\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\">4. Applicants must be under 25 years of age as of March.1st, 2019(born after March. 1, 1994).<o:p></o:p></span></p><p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-layout-grid-align: none\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\"><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-layout-grid-align: none\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\">5. In case of submitting photocopied documents, applicants MUST have the copies notarized or apostilled and then submit the notarized or apostilled copies. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGI