-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\"><font size=\"2\">고등학교 전학년 성적평균 평점<span lang=\"EN-US\">(CGPA)</span></font><font size=\"2\">이 </font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font size=\"2\">4.0</font></span><font size=\"2\">만점에 </font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font size=\"2\">2.64</font></span><font size=\"2\">이상</font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font size=\"2\">, 4.3</font></span><font size=\"2\">만점에 </font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font size=\"2\">2.80</font></span><font size=\"2\">이상</font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font size=\"2\">, 4.5 </font></span><font size=\"2\">만점에 </font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font size=\"2\">2.91 </font></span><font size=\"2\">이상</font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font size=\"2\">, 5.0 </font></span><font size=\"2\">만점에 </font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font size=\"2\">3.23 </font></span><font size=\"2\">이상인자</font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font size=\"2\">, </font></span><font size=\"2\">또는 백분율 환산 점수가 </font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font size=\"2\">80</font></span><font size=\"2\">점 이상 혹은 성적 상위 </font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font size=\"2\">20%</font></span><font size=\"2\">이내인자<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></font></span></p><p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 38pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-ha